## How the procedure grows

`e.e9` — Mapping skeleton

Change ID + associated action IDs

Add procedural categories

`e.e10` — Expanded procedure

Same mappings + order, preconditions, instructions, expected changes, verification

Add simulation categories

`e.e11` — Simulated procedure

